From 18d9366bfb0d2241276462e868f0cab499746c30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:02:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The flip: beds on, HRTF voices to 8 (ADR 0162 A5 + A6b, #123,
 #125)

bedInitParams lays out audio.bed.maxBeds slots, so the planner sends BED_CONFIG and the voices past voices.hrtf mix into
their bus's bed. DEFAULT_VOICES.hrtf 16 -> 8; VOICE_PRESETS HRTF 4/8/8 with maxBeds 0/2/4 and maxClips 1/1/2 (the
comparison reads them); the stress sample takes the high preset's numbers (hrtf 8, maxBeds 4, maxClips 2). Tests that
assumed 16 or 32 HRTF voices updated; a loopback test follows a bus edit with the real wasm. Not to merge until A7's bed
bench is recorded and the gates are checked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QjpoPsrMm54T1mEmV5vciB
